<p>Fire a powerful beam of stone-shattering force, digging out any walls in its path up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> range.</p><p>The beam continues to a range of 10, affecting any creatures in its path, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">140, 188, 226, 258, 286</acronym> physical damage to them.</p><p>If any walls are dug, you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 20%, 23%, 27%, 30%</acronym> physical damage bonus for 6 turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>